<title>USA: America West February load factor falls.</title>
<headline>America West February load factor falls.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following summarizes America West Airline's February and year-to-date traffic results for 1997 and 1996:</p>
<p>				    Feb. 1997     Feb. 1996   % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Enplaned	     1,411,689     1,387,264	1.8</p>
<p>Revenue Passenger Miles(000)  1,209,481     1,120,361	8.0</p>
<p>Available Seat Miles (000)    1,804,651     1,593,662     13.2</p>
<p>Load Factor (percent)		  67.0	    70.3</p>
<p>				     YTD 1997	YTD 1996   % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Enplaned	     2,858,593     2,687,956	6.3</p>
<p>Revenue Passenger Miles(000)  2,454,217     2,161,491     13.5</p>
<p>Available Seat Miles (000)    3,779,416     3,218,185     17.4</p>
<p>Load Factor (percent)		  64.9	    67.2</p>
</text>
